{% comment %}
  购物车行项（pages-ui §10 · task-cart T-1.2）。

  DOM 契约：
    · `#cart-form` —— 摘要卡的结账按钮靠 `form="cart-form"` 关联到它（两个 section
      不能共用一个 <form> 元素，只能用 form 属性）。改这个 id 时同步 cart-summary。
    · `<cart-items>` —— assets/cart-items.js 的根。所有 AJAX 行为挂在元素内部，
      不向 document 派发全局委托（AGENTS.md §6）。
    · `data-cart-section` —— 局部刷新时 Section Rendering 的返回键；脚本靠它找回来替换。

  无 JS：表单照常 POST /cart，整页刷新；数量输入为原生 number，移除为 <a>（GET 生效）。
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%}
  脚本只在本 section 需要——购物车页专属，不挂 layout（page-only JS 不占全站带宽）。
  defer：解析完成后执行，不阻塞首屏。
{% endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'cart-items.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

<cart-items
  class="cart-lines"
  data-cart-section="{{ section.id }}"
  data-cart-change-url="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}.js"
  data-cart-live-template="{{ 'cart.total_updated' | t: total: '[total]' }}"
  data-cart-product-ids="{{ cart.items | map: 'product_id' | join: ',' }}"
  data-error-message="{{ 'products.product_card.add_error' | t }}"
>
  <h1 class="cart-lines__title" tabindex="-1">
    {{ 'cart.title' | t }}
    {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
      <span class="cart-lines__count" aria-hidden="true">({{ cart.item_count }})</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </h1>

  {%- if cart.item_count == 0 -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      空态（T-1.6）：独占本栏，摘要卡此时整节不输出（cart-summary 里判同一个条件）。
      不放任何金额、不放倒计时/库存话术——空购物车里那些全是伪造的数据。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="cart-lines__empty">
      <p class="cart-lines__empty-heading">{{ 'cart.empty_heading' | t }}</p>
      <p class="cart-lines__empty-text">{{ 'cart.empty_text' | t }}</p>
      <a class="btn-solid cart-lines__empty-cta" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
        {{- 'cart.continue_shopping' | t -}}
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <form id="cart-form" class="cart-lines__form" action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" novalidate>
      <ul class="cart-lines__list" role="list">
        {%- for item in cart.items -%}
          <li class="cart-lines__item" data-line-key="{{ item.key }}">
            {%- render 'cart-line', item: item, show_stock: section.settings.show_stock -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      {%- comment -%}
        无 JS 的「Update」按钮：JS 环境下藏起来（数量变化即提交），
        但**不能从 DOM 移除**——移除后键盘/无 JS 用户就没有提交路径了。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cart-lines__actions">
        <button type="submit" name="update" class="btn-solid btn-solid--quiet cart-lines__update">
          {{- 'cart.update_cart' | t -}}
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>
  {%- endif -%}
</cart-items>

{% stylesheet %}
  cart-items {
    display: block;
  }

  .cart-lines__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
  }
  .cart-lines__count {
    font-size: 0.5em;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    margin-inline-start: 0.35em;
  }

  .cart-lines__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-block-start: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
  }
  .cart-lines__item {
    border-block-end: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
  }

  /* ---- 单行 ---- */
  .cart-line {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cart-line__media a {
    display: block;
  }
  .cart-line__media img,
  .cart-line__placeholder {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 4%, transparent);
  }

  .cart-line__body {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .cart-line__info {
    /* grid/flex item 的自动最小尺寸会按 min-content 撑开——长标题必须截断这个传导 */
    min-inline-size: 0;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .cart-line__title {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .cart-line__title:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .cart-line__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .cart-line__meta li + li::before {
    content: '·';
    margin-inline-end: 0.35rem;
  }

  .cart-line__plan,
  .cart-line__discount,
  .cart-line__stock {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .cart-line__plan {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .cart-line__discount {
    color: var(--color-sale);
  }
  .cart-line__stock {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .cart-line__logistics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .cart-line__logistics-tag {
    padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-warning-on);
    background-color: var(--color-warning);
  }

  /* ---- 价格 / 数量 / 小计 ---- */
  .cart-line__numbers {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: end;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }
  .cart-line__price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .cart-line__price-compare,
  .cart-line__total-compare {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .cart-line__unit {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }

  .cart-line__qty {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 16%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .cart-line__qty-btn {
    /* 触摸目标 44×44（AGENTS.md §8 / SDD §8.2） */
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .cart-line__qty-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 10%, transparent);
  }
  .cart-line__qty-btn:disabled {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 35%, transparent);
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .cart-line__qty-input {
    inline-size: 2.75rem;
    block-size: 44px;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    text-align: center;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    /* 原生数字输入的上下箭头挤在 44px 内会压住数字 */
    appearance: textfield;
  }
  .cart-line__qty-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  .cart-line__qty-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
    appearance: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cart-line__total {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .cart-line__remove {
    min-block-size: 44px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .cart-line__remove:hover {
    color: var(--color-sale);
  }

  .cart-lines__actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-block-start: 1rem;
  }
  .cart-lines__update {
    padding-inline: 1.25rem;
  }
  /* 有 JS 时数量即改即提交，「Update」确实冗余，但**不隐藏**：
     cart-items.js 加载失败而 .js 类已经写上时，藏掉它会让顾客彻底没有提交路径。
     多一个按钮的代价远小于一个死掉的购物车。 */

  /* ---- 空态 ---- */
  .cart-lines__empty {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding-block: 2.5rem 3rem;
  }
  .cart-lines__empty-heading {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .cart-lines__empty-text {
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    max-inline-size: 42ch;
  }
  .cart-lines__empty-cta {
    margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* ---- 窄屏：图与文字上下不再并排，数字区换到标题下方 ---- */
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .cart-line {
      grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .cart-line__body {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .cart-line__numbers {
      justify-items: start;
      grid-template-columns: auto auto;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .cart-line__qty {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
    .cart-line__total {
      grid-column: 2;
      justify-self: end;
    }
    .cart-line__remove {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      justify-self: start;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.cart_lines.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "cart-lines-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_stock",
      "label": "t:sections.cart_lines.labels.show_stock",
      "info": "t:sections.cart_lines.labels.show_stock_info",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.cart_lines.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
